🧩 Main Components
1. MainActivity

MainActivity.kt is responsible for:

Creating the main application interface
Creating the ListView
Creating the student data
Connecting the StudentAdapter
Handling student item clicks
2. Student Data Class

Student.kt stores the information of each student:

data class Student(
    val name: String,
    val course: String,
    val imageName: String
)
3. StudentAdapter

StudentAdapter.kt connects the student data with the ListView.

It displays:

Student image
Student name
Student course

The adapter dynamically loads images from the drawable folder.

🖼️ Image Resources

Student images are stored inside:

app/src/main/res/drawable/

Example:

student1.jpg
student2.jpg
student3.jpg
student4.jpg

The application dynamically identifies the corresponding drawable resource based on the image name.

🚀 How to Run
Clone the repository:
git clone https://github.com/YOUR_USERNAME/adaptive-android-listview-imageview.git
Open the project in Android Studio.
Allow Gradle to sync.
Connect an Android device or start an Android Emulator.
Click Run ▶.
The application will display the Student List.
